# How to play, Profile (a guest names themself), Score chase, the Daily
# setup and Settings from the title, the Challenges list.
until 300 Play
frames 10
click How to play
until 60 Impostors
frames 10
save help
key Escape 2
until 60 Play
frames 10
click Profile
until 60 Statistics
frames 10
click profile-name
frames 5
type Ada
frames 5
click Save
until 30 Display name saved
frames 10
save profile
key Escape 2
until 60 Play
frames 10
click Daily challenge
until 60 Ranked — the result counts toward leaderboards.
frames 10
save daily-setup
click Back
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click Score Chase
until 60 Score chase
frames 30
save boards
key Escape 2
until 60 Play
frames 10
click Play
until 60 Choose a mode
frames 10
click Challenge
until 60 Frugal Hands
frames 10
save challenges
click Studio Sprint
until 120 Rotate
frames 30
expect Time:
save sprint
